# Elite Licensing Discipline

- CaseSpace is licensed under BUSL-1.1 (`LICENSE`), not MIT/Apache.
- Do not change package `license` fields to permissive OSS licenses without explicit user approval.
- Commercial/production revenue-generating use requires a separate commercial license (`COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md`).
- Keep `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`, and `COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md` synchronized when licensing terms change.
- Public repository visibility is allowed for distribution, but license terms still prohibit unauthorized commercial use.
